<title>HONG KONG: Keck Seng interim net down 38 percent.</title>
<headline>Keck Seng interim net down 38 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 28.31     vs 45.79 (adjusted)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  6.0	 vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	7.72 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			  64.21     vs 103.86</p>
<p>    Turnover		   101.16    vs 333.15</p>
<p>    Company name	     Keck Seng Investments (Hong Kong) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		October 9-14</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 October 22</p>
<p>NOTE - Keck Seng Investments participates in property trading, rental and investment.</p>
<p>Comparative share earnings have been adjusted for the 37.8 million bonus shares issued on October 16, 1995.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of an investment property including the transfer of the related revaluation surplus from reserve upon realisation.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
